Android Phone Agent
Copyright 2026 Android Phone Agent contributors

This project is an Android port of ESP32 iPhone Agent by Henry Yuan
(https://github.com/onehumanbeing/esp32-iphone-agent, MIT). The agent-loop
design, prompt structure (prompts/actor.md, prompts/planner.md,
prompts/app-rules.md) and the run-trace concept are derived from that project.

If you build on this project, keep the LICENSE and credit both
"ESP32 iPhone Agent by Henry Yuan" and this repository in your README and posts.
